Name:Sneaky Werewolf
Desc:The Sneaky Werewolf wakes up with the rest of the Wolves and chooses a target to attack with them. The Sneaky Werewolf is disguised as a Citizen. If the Sneaky Werewolf is investigated but the card does not need to be turned over, the Game Master will pretend that the Sneaky Werewolf is actually a Citizen.
